Speech model (downloaded at runtime, never bundled)

NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3, (c) NVIDIA, licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Original model: https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3

The files downloaded are the INT8 ONNX conversion by Ivan Stupakov, pinned to
revision 8f23f0c03c8761650bdb5b40aaf3e40d2c15f1ce with a SHA-256 check per file:
https://huggingface.co/istupakov/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-onnx
Change from the original: INT8 ONNX conversion. No fine-tuning.

